    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u203bIf the game runs too fast or too slow, please refer to the </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Performance Notes&quot; section at the bottom of this page.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udca5 About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fast-paced, retro-inspired 3D shooting action game<br>created as a heartfelt homage to arcade classics from the '80s and '90s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are ASURA, a humanoid combat weapon built to eliminate an alien invasion from space. <br>Master high-speed shooting, powerful melee attacks, and time-bending slow motion mechanics.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Energy Shot</strong> \u2013 your rapid-fire ranged weapon</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shining Knuckle</strong> \u2013 a charged punch for devastating damage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lightning Over Drive</strong> \u2013 slow down time and control the battlefield </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae Core Action Highlights </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389830/extras/03e84eb18412cbea723237db1f3b61e4.poster.avif?t=1755017535\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389830/extras/03e84eb18412cbea723237db1f3b61e4.webm?t=1755017535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389830/extras/03e84eb18412cbea723237db1f3b61e4.mp4?t=1755017535\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wipe out swarms of alien invaders! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389830/extras/0588d2ee7c9fcf91ee13d34199e96d3f.poster.avif?t=1755017535\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389830/extras/0588d2ee7c9fcf91ee13d34199e96d3f.webm?t=1755017535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389830/extras/0588d2ee7c9fcf91ee13d34199e96d3f.mp4?t=1755017535\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Use Lightning Over Drive to escape danger! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389830/extras/c83bf3c62eb91e4c1f8750fff75011fd.poster.avif?t=1755017535\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389830/extras/c83bf3c62eb91e4c1f8750fff75011fd.webm?t=1755017535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389830/extras/c83bf3c62eb91e4c1f8750fff75011fd.mp4?t=1755017535\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Destroy powerful enemies with a single punch! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389830/extras/99fd9409ee56de44848427813c0374ac.poster.avif?t=1755017535\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389830/extras/99fd9409ee56de44848427813c0374ac.webm?t=1755017535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389830/extras/99fd9409ee56de44848427813c0374ac.mp4?t=1755017535\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Face off against terrifying alien bosses! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389830/extras/67223bb8bdab139f8acf3ecd61d72402.poster.avif?t=1755017535\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389830/extras/67223bb8bdab139f8acf3ecd61d72402.webm?t=1755017535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389830/extras/67223bb8bdab139f8acf3ecd61d72402.mp4?t=1755017535\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Controls</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Movement</strong>: Use the left stick or D-pad.<br>(You can choose in the menu whether the stick</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >returns to the center or stays in place when released.\uff09</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Energy Shot</strong>: Press the shot button to fire.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shining Knuckle</strong>: Hold the punch button, then release to strike.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lightning Over Drive</strong>: Press the slow button to slow time (consumes energy gauge).</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddea About the Developers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LeftOver</strong> is a new indie label founded by just two developers.<br>Everything\u2014from planning, programming, and design, to sound and beyond\u2014<br>is created entirely by the two of us.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We're taking our time to build something special,<br>and we truly appreciate your support and wishlist additions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u203bPerformance Notes</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're using a monitor with a refresh rate higher than 60Hz,</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > you may experience issues where the game runs too fast or too slow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In such cases, try turning off vertical sync (vSync) in the game's settings.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The BGM and sound effect volume settings are currently locked as we are still making adjustments. They are expected to be adjustable in the next update.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u203bIf the game runs too fast or too slow, please refer to the </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Performance Notes&quot; section at the bottom of this page.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udca5 About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fast-paced, retro-inspired 3D shooting action game<br>created as a heartfelt homage to arcade classics from the '80s and '90s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are ASURA, a humanoid combat weapon built to eliminate an alien invasion from space. <br>Master high-speed shooting, powerful melee attacks, and time-bending slow motion mechanics.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Energy Shot</strong> \u2013 your rapid-fire ranged weapon</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shining Knuckle</strong> \u2013 a charged punch for devastating damage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lightning Over Drive</strong> \u2013 slow down time and control the battlefield </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae Core Action Highlights </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389830/extras/03e84eb18412cbea723237db1f3b61e4.poster.avif?t=1755017535\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389830/extras/03e84eb18412cbea723237db1f3b61e4.webm?t=1755017535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389830/extras/03e84eb18412cbea723237db1f3b61e4.mp4?t=1755017535\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wipe out swarms of alien invaders! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389830/extras/0588d2ee7c9fcf91ee13d34199e96d3f.poster.avif?t=1755017535\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389830/extras/0588d2ee7c9fcf91ee13d34199e96d3f.webm?t=1755017535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389830/extras/0588d2ee7c9fcf91ee13d34199e96d3f.mp4?t=1755017535\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Use Lightning Over Drive to escape danger! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389830/extras/c83bf3c62eb91e4c1f8750fff75011fd.poster.avif?t=1755017535\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389830/extras/c83bf3c62eb91e4c1f8750fff75011fd.webm?t=1755017535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389830/extras/c83bf3c62eb91e4c1f8750fff75011fd.mp4?t=1755017535\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Destroy powerful enemies with a single punch! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389830/extras/99fd9409ee56de44848427813c0374ac.poster.avif?t=1755017535\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389830/extras/99fd9409ee56de44848427813c0374ac.webm?t=1755017535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389830/extras/99fd9409ee56de44848427813c0374ac.mp4?t=1755017535\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Face off against terrifying alien bosses! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389830/extras/67223bb8bdab139f8acf3ecd61d72402.poster.avif?t=1755017535\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389830/extras/67223bb8bdab139f8acf3ecd61d72402.webm?t=1755017535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389830/extras/67223bb8bdab139f8acf3ecd61d72402.mp4?t=1755017535\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Controls</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Movement</strong>: Use the left stick or D-pad.<br>(You can choose in the menu whether the stick</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >returns to the center or stays in place when released.\uff09</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Energy Shot</strong>: Press the shot button to fire.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shining Knuckle</strong>: Hold the punch button, then release to strike.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lightning Over Drive</strong>: Press the slow button to slow time (consumes energy gauge).</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddea About the Developers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LeftOver</strong> is a new indie label founded by just two developers.<br>Everything\u2014from planning, programming, and design, to sound and beyond\u2014<br>is created entirely by the two of us.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We're taking our time to build something special,<br>and we truly appreciate your support and wishlist additions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u203bPerformance Notes</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're using a monitor with a refresh rate higher than 60Hz,</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > you may experience issues where the game runs too fast or too slow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In such cases, try turning off vertical sync (vSync) in the game's settings.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The BGM and sound effect volume settings are currently locked as we are still making adjustments. They are expected to be adjustable in the next update.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
